        "eat :parameters (?m - wolf ?c - human ?location - (either house room)) :precondition (and (alive ?m) (alive ?c) (not (eaten ?c)) (at ?m ?location) (at ?c ?location) (monster ?m)) :effect (and (eaten ?c)))": "(:action eat :parameters (?m - wolf ?c - human ?location - (either house room)) :precondition (and (alive ?m) (alive ?c) (not (eaten ?c)) (at ?m ?location) (at ?c ?location) (monster ?m)) :effect (and (eaten ?c)))",
